  {
    "hotel_id": "286608",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/hotel-nikko-saigon/hotel/ho-chi-minh-city-vn.html",
    "name": "Hotel Nikko Saigon",
    "detail": "My partner and I stayed in Ho Chi Minh city for a night before returning home. This hotel is located in District 3/5 which I found was a great convenience as there was a shopping centre located next door and abundant restaurants nearby. I have been to Ho Chi Minh on several occasions and stayed at other 5 star hotels, however I was most impressed with Nikko for their professional, friendly staff and the room in which stayed was just lovely. On check in, we were upgraded to Club executive room due to high occupancy so that was a nice surprise. The bed was comfortable (softer than most hotel beds you'll find in Vietnam. We'd spent 8 nights in Nha Trang at the Sheraton before arriving in Ho Chi Minh and for the sake of comparison, the Nikko is comparable to that. Lovely hotel - I will stay here the next time I am in Ho Chi Minh. ",
